<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ICI Australia to buy some ICI Plc shrs.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ICI Australia to buy some ICI Plc shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Australia Ltd said on Friday it proposes to buy back A$360 million worth of its own shares from Imperial Chemicals Industries Plc, which is selling its 62.4 percent stake in ICI Australia.</p>
<p>ICI Australia said the buyback is priced at a maximum of A$11.96 per share.</p>
</text>
